WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.886
Veterans Affairs Canada.

00:00:01.886 --> 00:00:06.125
The department responsible for supporting military veterans offered them death instead.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:09.965
At least four veterans calling for PTSD help were offered MAID.

00:00:09.965 --> 00:00:12.943
The department claimed it was one isolated employee.

00:00:12.943 --> 00:00:15.556
More veterans from different offices came forward.
